<title>PHILIPPINES: Aboitiz Q1 net at 260 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Aboitiz Q1 net at 260 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aboitiz Equity Ventures Inc said on Wednesday it posted a net income of 260 million pesos in the first quarter of the year.</p>
<p>Revenues reached 978 million pesos during the period.</p>
<p>The company gave no comparisons.  </p>
<p>The company told the Philippine Stock Exchange the transportation-based holding company itself earned 42.3 million pesos.</p>
<p>Its electricity subsidiary contributed 86.3 million pesos, the banking unit, 103.2 million pesos, and portfolio investments, 28.2 million pesos.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
